{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/d1z4qggibcx2thkyh38pb45hfjscvyg.mp3","text":"我、我认识字......我能帮上忙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/g2apdg5qwzjpznvv3d655fhxw4hwwht.mp3","text":"抱、抱歉，我说话，很慢。华法琳医、医生说，能治好，但是要......很久。没关系，我已经习、习惯了。嗯，只要不会，让您，觉得烦......就好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/ppd1bfy1r79w0jecszmorc96hswc0ff.mp3","text":"我，手里的？不是草药，是、是一种苔藓。以前，矿工会、会用它烧火，还有，泡水喝。颜色，很好看？嗯。在苔原上，它很显眼，所以很、很早就被人摘光啦。这是最、最后一点，我想，留着。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/oojlg7c19ykvgnir74lnj1z3bczj7ls.mp3","text":"您让我敲、敲响钟？想看看我，在矿井是、是怎么工作的......好吧。其实，它算不上，一口钟，只是敲起来，声音......很吵。不，您一定得，捂着耳朵......一定。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/s77h09zhygvm6pc12r9rjh7lawce2yq.mp3","text":"在矿井里，很容易，忘记时间。我就在外、外面，帮他们数着，不能太久，不然他们会、会死。一百一十一，一百一十二，一百一十三......就、就像这样。数的时候很、很流利？欸——欸？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/731bnn6gqr05ebfivhfafpa4cx4r3m2.mp3","text":"对着矿洞，说话，有奇怪的回、回音。我笑，它也笑。我凶它，它就凶我。其实有、有些人，也和矿洞一样——雷尔金，他见到了太多......很复杂的事，最后，也变得，复杂。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/2qbqjfjozb59o41vije5a0ttnflvjki.mp3","text":"这封信，和里面的麦、麦穗，是他们从边境寄给，我的。开心？嗯。好像，大家最后都、都会走散，然后再也不见？真奇怪，一想到他们的笑，眼睛就、就会酸。欸？您说......不奇怪吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/co808l8gfwtnw2pf6idcquxftp1ybqx.mp3","text":"您听、听说过吗？父母出门去、去铲雪，不久有人敲门，孩子去开门，发现，那是像人一样，站起来的裂兽——我不敢再——不、不止是因为娜迦奶奶。您、您说得对。真的家人，不会，逼我开门。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/jbyjqna1qiu5g6z3lamkkuih68gnayc.mp3","text":"没、没有走神！在数太阳，落下去......要多久。舍、舍不得？嗯，在北、北方，太阳，很宝贵，所以害怕，它不、不回来了——明早？您、您愿意，陪我等它......升起来？真的吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/l83zpz163ai537597mthiapcbms0wo2.mp3","text":"您已经工作很、很长时间了，需要，休息一下吗......我会记得，叫醒您的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/h901gxb0nbtq5ytlybcxqbuaog989ex.mp3","text":"您、您好，博士！大家都叫我......别乔克，嗯——嗯，对，就是小、小树枝的意思！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/e7jyo628mvqvcw0uz14etzum117nskg.mp3","text":"我......只需要保、保护好大家......应该就、就可以了吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/ffuxbifdtzsh1gmlrwqs0923742lfq1.mp3","text":"我不怕......吃苦，也不、不怕疼！我会更努力......训练，您可以相、相信我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/qospor7qbvymh24x2l0eev1nfy9zom9.mp3","text":"勋章，是给——我的？可是我做得还、还不够。还有好多，感染者......我会帮、帮助更多人！嗯，您、您说得对，我们......一起。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/805m8n9w8hr107e7b0yut8x2ydy34d5.mp3","text":"嗯，好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/90st08mzc03fab5utxvhlct0seocxkc.mp3","text":"敲响......警钟！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/nyzjr7kmyvienfiydjag9yj96b7xpcj.mp3","text":"请务必......注意安全。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/g4xdnn67om0y8jnwl4zlrpdswnkw02w.mp3","text":"小心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/hpm90j3k8d200r5xxwownmusvo2r8pa.mp3","text":"我......可以！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/njyts4n7fvrmzvkzw3mxknhhstfl9oi.mp3","text":"我......明白！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/hjhkl6a1tzrwup585kjgiwadbd3hmfs.mp3","text":"不要害怕！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/t7908dgb421iqc83jn5j6v85amyj3kh.mp3","text":"不要再、再靠近了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/skftjsztzcd8vl1fir04daembmqomb2.mp3","text":"七百二十三，七百二十二，七百二十一......活下去......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/70/efdyrv2ojqrbhmx1nfxma5hf0x5s7wf.mp3","text":"五十九，六十。一，二......深呼吸......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/21/s7day6ltgltrj4h0lbbp38f38u5xca7.mp3","text":"再坚、坚持一会儿......","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/afqua2vddnk90wefr3mksx3k52te731.mp3","text":"时、时间到！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/pnfti54x9o13frufr5qj3uku0v8yzh8.mp3","text":"我们......做到了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/b29i307ho6296uibl76bypwzt32yur5.mp3","text":"可、可以休息了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/tna5wt9zgrwnc9qi99k2lztq5qi3m57.mp3","text":"大家......不要走散了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/bv1b0wcc0xcr7vspm3vra1mauuhhcb2.mp3","text":"我们要回、回去，那里还有......我们的人！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/dgb6owhv7wljogovc7o05yhj1any6mk.mp3","text":"这里......很暖和。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/2vk82evgrwzcx3ynl82fun1adgc9ih5.mp3","text":"请您......快、快松开！","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/skgr0v642pih8z0m3tzd026lp76pcjo.mp3","text":"很久，很久以前，有一、一个迷路的......小雪人......这、这个故事，您听过吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/cecfry02z4r4qookfwo8uh7yzr9j3z0.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/fohqf14zd84cnupmj1gk05c0z68bjs1.mp3","text":"再、再往左一点，这样就好......啊，又、又偏了。右边请再抬高......一点点就好——好、好了！博士，谢谢您帮我，挂节日彩、彩灯！马上就可以，敲响，新年钟声了，要试试吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/l6hqo9tsf2arjcrtvxgi8an1wwsn7bx.mp3","text":"博、博士，您很准时......嗯，我也刚、刚刚才到。","alt":"voice_cn/char_4207_branch/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/761bovk6u93j7acisu7b54vvd8xi2rt.mp3","text":"我、我认识字......我能帮上忙。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/eqhujxzu21t8ky9ts7l9u8qm5dtskw3.mp3","text":"抱、抱歉，我说话，很慢。华法琳医、医生说，能治好，但是要......很久。没关系，我已经习、习惯了。嗯，只要不会，让您，觉得烦......就好。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/0mg86ou47cbsgqlbfh10iiyih85yo0r.mp3","text":"我，手里的？不是草药，是、是一种苔藓。以前，矿工会、会用它烧火，还有，泡水喝。颜色，很好看？嗯。在苔原上，它很显眼，所以很、很早就被人摘光啦。这是最、最后一点，我想，留着。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/5x4tnvcxr41dap8nzm4nuobc5vsz17v.mp3","text":"您让我敲、敲响钟？想看看我，在矿井是、是怎么工作的......好吧。其实，它算不上，一口钟，只是敲起来，声音......很吵。不，您一定得，捂着耳朵......一定。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/h56n64f0iu70g1ld12d99jmlrj7i1tz.mp3","text":"在矿井里，很容易，忘记时间。我就在外、外面，帮他们数着，不能太久，不然他们会、会死。一百一十一，一百一十二，一百一十三......就、就像这样。数的时候很、很流利？欸——欸？","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/89/lzwv2vlj32x9o7g8xbb5mu7okzuer8r.mp3","text":"对着矿洞，说话，有奇怪的回、回音。我笑，它也笑。我凶它，它就凶我。其实有、有些人，也和矿洞一样——雷尔金，他见到了太多......很复杂的事，最后，也变得，复杂。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/66/m549p0o16w61k84pu9j6i8qwdjcse8o.mp3","text":"这封信，和里面的麦、麦穗，是他们从边境寄给，我的。开心？嗯。好像，大家最后都、都会走散，然后再也不见？真奇怪，一想到他们的笑，眼睛就、就会酸。欸？您说......不奇怪吗？","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/6cuku95afbj9e5ppbzdx2qo8xkz2nsk.mp3","text":"您听、听说过吗？父母出门去、去铲雪，不久有人敲门，孩子去开门，发现，那是像人一样，站起来的裂兽——我不敢再——不、不止是因为娜迦奶奶。您、您说得对。真的家人，不会，逼我开门。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/46/8k9mjfee0m9mcl2xvevtybk0uizxg9b.mp3","text":"没、没有走神！在数太阳，落下去......要多久。舍、舍不得？嗯，在北、北方，太阳，很宝贵，所以害怕，它不、不回来了——明早？您、您愿意，陪我等它......升起来？真的吗？","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/e9nhea38g6edwoz6n2onqvwsou6r8hr.mp3","text":"您已经工作很、很长时间了，需要，休息一下吗......我会记得，叫醒您的。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/5jnh9n0ku6nv634lwm1izsmmimdfyiy.mp3","text":"您、您好，博士！大家都叫我......别乔克，嗯——嗯，对，就是小、小树枝的意思！","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/2guzcjxpc4701si978t3ws1xv5w9105.mp3","text":"我......只需要保、保护好大家......应该就、就可以了吧？","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/hlrbdol7fx6mv7v418hvnbjwcxs1ckg.mp3","text":"我不怕......吃苦，也不、不怕疼！我会更努力......训练，您可以相、相信我。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/m6t4uuqojzqd620sd5o992fv1swvdrv.mp3","text":"勋章，是给——我的？可是我做得还、还不够。还有好多，感染者......我会帮、帮助更多人！嗯，您、您说得对，我们......一起。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/0vh3kkzgu5pct17b8k6eywubbrfujr8.mp3","text":"嗯，好。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/061t2pu019ef8tjiyjhfw951vjj7e2b.mp3","text":"敲响......警钟！","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/f18z7yop536ai26wg6xxocs3imj4zhv.mp3","text":"请务必......注意安全。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/8x1idp5rmlescoothnzu7x5tvrto8fu.mp3","text":"小心。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/159t4dejjesl7l572lcp6gerlazhfit.mp3","text":"我......可以！","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/2ofbkpz59lh2cx23g3aib16ws3wfa46.mp3","text":"我......明白！","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/akftoa391p1uz82cg67oaa55lh9kau6.mp3","text":"不要害怕！","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/h3e31iesz1ju3acsbs9p16sozox1d3j.mp3","text":"不要再、再靠近了。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/5fhehlcpfhgscbx1w8warjeoj3g20sv.mp3","text":"七百二十三，七百二十二，七百二十一......活下去......","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/tt9e48cb5hawufleuvlbbft16400b07.mp3","text":"五十九，六十。一，二......深呼吸......","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/abl6j8rsymplya8m0v2yuollzl30tzt.mp3","text":"再坚、坚持一会儿......","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/nn8jxyhdl8aooba5xrh5jj5etf6qqzd.mp3","text":"时、时间到！","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/tvr61ua68g8hfa7j91ev609h2xdgvob.mp3","text":"我们......做到了吗？","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/i7qs86zim29xqtetbcyatbg4s15pkkj.mp3","text":"可、可以休息了吗？","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/st1do86rgzyw1iz90k64fy49681gcua.mp3","text":"大家......不要走散了。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/tdqb2an2c243p1b8fpcmq7m64y7l8tm.mp3","text":"我们要回、回去，那里还有......我们的人！","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/krmpw2bqw5y0srt8y63v92561v1omnl.mp3","text":"这里......很暖和。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/hbngmlhuizmbhd0svbvbcn5u4t4hz13.mp3","text":"请您......快、快松开！","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/fjb887gq422odbvn46rqvey0378potv.mp3","text":"很久，很久以前，有一、一个迷路的......小雪人......这、这个故事，您听过吗？","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/cel1q56o0spozo1g4dmdpouhdftdmfk.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/4588oy4ffdzktcc1egg0aepftiyv1ek.mp3","text":"再、再往左一点，这样就好......啊，又、又偏了。右边请再抬高......一点点就好——好、好了！博士，谢谢您帮我，挂节日彩、彩灯！马上就可以，敲响，新年钟声了，要试试吗？","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/kjol8shomv5ftn49yajflnicjunpfm4.mp3","text":"博、博士，您很准时......嗯，我也刚、刚刚才到。","alt":"voice/char_4207_branch/cn_042.mp3"}]}}